# ============================================================
# DispatchResolve AI
# Git Ignore Policy
#
# Protect secrets, customer data, local databases, generated
# audio, build artifacts, and developer-specific settings.
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment variables and credentials
# ------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
credentials.json
secrets.json
service-account*.json
*secret*.local
*credentials*.local

